,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=-\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s$ and $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =-\\frac{1}{({e}^{st})^{2}}=-{e}^{-2st}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =-\\frac{1}{({e}^{-st})^{2}}=-{e}^{2st}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x$ and $y$ with respect to $s,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂s} & =t{e}^{st}, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂s} & =-t{e}^{-st}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂s} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{∂x}{∂s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{∂y}{∂s} \\\\  & =(-{e}^{-2st})(t{e}^{st})+(-{e}^{2st})(-t{e}^{-st}) \\\\  & =t{e}^{st}-t{e}^{-st} \\\\  & =t({e}^{st}-{e}^{-st}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362984 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362986 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362987 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362988 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186362984 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362983 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "1b62b53e-864d-5c41-bf41-a59840c727e8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362984 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}({e}^{\\pi }-1)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362984 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362984 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "28f429c0-4106-53ea-9c7e-5a3e5c69557c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362985 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{5}(2{e}^{2\\pi }-1)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362985 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175921863